	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia Christi tecum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><persName>Paulus</persName> ille <persName ref="p4744">Pauli Fagi<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>i</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>sanctę memorię filius, superioribus diebus ex <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> rediens apud suum affinem <persName ref="p3273">Ioannem Ulstetterum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>scholę nostrę paedotribam, divertit consulturus de <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>alio loco studiis commodiori.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Conventum est autem <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>inter nos tandem concorditer <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinam</placeName> academiam <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ob multas commoditates illi profuturam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Non displicuit <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>adolescenti sententia, atque quam primum accinctus se <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>discrimini vię, at a tot sanguinariis militibus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>obsessam, commisit etc.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Porro ut illum tibi pluribus comm<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>endem, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> doctissime, opus non fuerit; nam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ipse pietatis ac eruditionis, tum et honestatis, ni alius<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>, quod absit, quam hactenus velit esse, dabit <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>luculentum specimen per omnia, ut speramus, patrem <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>relaturus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Tu ergo illum illiusque studia pro tua sin<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>gulari humanitate, qua propensus es erga omnes <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>studiosos, iuvato ac promoveto, inprimis ut habeat <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>hospitium se dignum; nam omnes bene speramus, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>quod non sit falsurus nostram expectationem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Nos hic inter tot heroum, urbium vicinorumque bellicos <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>adparatus et strepitus pacifice agimus ab emulis <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>et osoribus tranquillitatis pessime audientes, quasi <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>nos, qui Christum profitemur, huius turbę simus causa.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Criminantur nos haud secus atque lupus ille, qui <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>apud scaturiginem bibens obiurgabat agnum infra se, quod <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>turbarit aquam.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Proinde minantur grandia dicentes se <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>totum hunc agellum, si a <persName>Gallo</persName> obsessi fuerint, funditus <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>eversurum.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Pridie ex <placeName>Brisaco</placeName> erruptionem fecerunt in tr<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>es viciniores principis pagos violenta manu comme<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>atum prędantes; sed per pręfectum nostrum abacti pedem <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>retulerunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Hoc unico exemplo intelligis, in quibus <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>versemur dis<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>criminibus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Hostis libertatem patrię <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>pollicetur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Utinam staremus in libertate, qua Christus <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>nos liberavit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Huiusmodi conatibus et technis non <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>video nos posse vindicare libertatem.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l832">Gallus</placeName> totam <lb xml:id="p2z10"/><placeName ref="l691">Lotharingiam</placeName> occupavit, iuniorem et superstitem ducem<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>, <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>qui decennis est, secum in exercitu ducens.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Quid <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>futurum sit, dies declarabit etc.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Rogate ergo filiu<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>m <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>dei pro nobis instantissime vos nostri fratres et ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>vestrę, ne in hisce tempestatibus ecclesiola nostra <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>a fluctibus bellicis obruatur, sed ut hanc <persName>Bethuliam</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>sua solita clementia ad gloriam sui nominis servet.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/>Hisce vale et saluta fratres omnes, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName> inprimis; <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>dic illi, ut se ferrea nunc ornet panoplia ad suę <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>patrię defensionem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l411">Richenvillę</placeName> 7. die maii 1552.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z25"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p1010">Erbius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z26"/>Salutat te <persName ref="p8088">Nicolaus Regius</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>viduus, qui, dum scribo, ad me venit<lb xml:id="p2z29"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z30"/>Cu<lb xml:id="p2z33"/>m<lb xml:id="p2z35"/>primis pieta<lb xml:id="p2z36"/>te et doctrina in<lb xml:id="p2z37"/>signi viro domino <lb xml:id="p2z39"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullin<lb xml:id="p2z41"/>gero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinorum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z43"/>theologo, fratri <lb xml:id="p2z45"/>suo ob<lb xml:id="p2z47"/>servan<lb xml:id="p2z52"/>do<lb xml:id="p2z53"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
